extends RefCounted
## What tools/build_icons.gd bakes into assets/ui/icons/<group>/<name>.png:
##   group -> {name: [source, colour, detail colour ("" = a light tint of the colour), options]}.
## Sources are SVGs under tools/icon_src without ".svg": "gi/<name>" = game-icons.net (CC BY 3.0; the file sits in
## its author's folder, see CREDITS.md), "at/<name>" = at-icons (MIT), "kenney/<name>" = Kenney Input Prompts
## flairs and Xbox prompts (CC0). Options: flip (mirror), scale (share of the full size), mono (a plain white shape
## with no outline or shading, for icons the button theme tints), prompt (a Kenney prompt in white with its coloured
## part, such as the pressed arm or the letter, cut out).

